    "## 1. Complaint Volume Trends (2017–2023)\n",
    "\n",
    "### Business Question\n",
    "How have consumer complaint volumes changed between 2017 and 2023?\n",
    "\n",
    "### Analytical Purpose\n",
    "Assess changes in complaint volumes over time, identify periods of increasing or decreasing complaint activity, and establish whether the observed trend indicates sustained changes or short-term fluctuations.\n",
    "\n",
    "### Measures\n",
    "- Annual complaint volume\n",
    "- Monthly complaint volume\n",
    "- Year-on-year percentage change\n",
    "- Average monthly complaint volume\n",
    "- Three-month rolling average\n",
    "\n",
    "### Important Considerations\n",
    "The dataset covers 1 May 2017 to 28 August 2023. Therefore, 2017 and 2023 are incomplete years and should not be compared directly with full calendar years without accounting for their different observation periods."
   ]
